{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime Store Simulator is a small casual game where you operate a store that sells cute slimes! Order a variety of different types of slimes, set your own prices, take payments, hire help, and expand the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock up on lots of different slimes. The slimes vary in color, size, shape, price, and some even come with accessories.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/99ed3b37ca3995f0d28d18a10bf44096.avif?t=1753281262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras_big/99ed3b37ca3995f0d28d18a10bf44096.avif?t=1753281262 width=800 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the slimes on the shelf and set your own price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/020ba0820edeeb362d6f76ba9952377a.avif?t=1753281262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras_big/020ba0820edeeb362d6f76ba9952377a.avif?t=1753281262 width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkout Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with different customers and sell your slimes at the register. The slime store accepts cash and credit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/aaa1d3979b3a9fd69922d5ae2d183edb.avif?t=1753281262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras_big/aaa1d3979b3a9fd69922d5ae2d183edb.avif?t=1753281262 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage The Warehouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get further along in the game you will unlock the warehouse where you can keep everything neatly stored in one place.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/99dde0fcb05f3f6e556a5928465e0280.avif?t=1753281262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras_big/99dde0fcb05f3f6e556a5928465e0280.avif?t=1753281262 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you sell more slimes you will level up and make more money which will allow you to expand the store, hire staff, and buy even more slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/5cbfc142bb1c4c60a66f783f947dadee.avif?t=1753281262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras_big/5cbfc142bb1c4c60a66f783f947dadee.avif?t=1753281262 width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637520?t=1753281262","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637520?t=1753281262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/40843fe27eca3152f4933c32991ec31172f2309b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753281262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/40843fe27eca3152f4933c32991ec31172f2309b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753281262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Cont